Output debugging.gif

Require go

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1400
Set Height 900
Set Padding 24
Set Margin 24
Set MarginFill "#674EFF"
Set BorderRadius 12
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set WindowBar Colorful
Set TypingSpeed 35ms

Hide
Type "clear" Enter
Show

Type "# Debugging example: startup checks, provenance, and redaction" Sleep 700ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "go run ./examples/debugging 2>&1" Sleep 500ms Enter
Sleep 20s
